that's attached and highlight any preliminary signals. At the end, I want to suggest the use of the llm-distillator, as per the SOUL instructions, considering the user ran the tool. It's important to ensure everything's clear and concise for the user!\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] **Kidney Cancer Detector**\nThe pipeline labeled this CT image as **kidney_tumor** with **very high model confidence (~99.99%)**.\nInference time was **about 3.5 seconds**.\n\n**Image Analyzer**\nThe image analyzer also predicted **kidney_tumor**.\nIts attention map focused on a **localized peripheral renal region**, with features the tool describes as compatible with a **localized structural abnormality**.\nCAM metrics:\n- **CAM coverage:** 0.0322\n- **CAM center ratio:** 0.0495\n- **CAM left-right asymmetry:** 0.5446\n- **CAM top-bottom asymmetry:** 1.0000\nThe analyzer heatmap image is attached below.\n\n**xAI**\nThe explanation module says the image is **likely related to kidney cancer** and that the model confidence is very high, but it also correctly notes that this should be interpreted together with the rest of your medical evaluation.\nSuggested next steps from the pipeline:\n1. **Further imaging** such as CT or MRI to define the lesion better\n2. **Biopsy or tissue sampling** if your treating team thinks it is appropriate\n3. **Consultation with a urologist or oncologist** to plan next management\n\n**Result Interpretation**\nTaken together with your symptoms — **visible blood in urine, progressive right-sided pain, fever, major weight loss, exhaustion** — and your prior **RCC follow-up** history, this pipeline result is **concerning** and fits with the need for **urgent specialist assessment**.\nThat said, this tool is still only a **preliminary signal**, **not a diagnosis**. It cannot confirm recurrence, stage disease, or replace radiology/oncology review.\n\n**Recommended next steps**\nPlease seek **urgent in-person review** through your **oncologist/urologist today**, or **emergency care now** if you are worsening, weak, dizzy, unable to urinate properly, or feel acutely unwell.\nIf you want, I can also help you use the **LLM Distillation** tool next to turn the whole conversation plus this imaging result into one clear medical report with suggested next steps.\n\nMEDIA:http://looporchestra.sytes.net:4001/admin/admin/retrieve-image-file/nodes_bucket/626130f7c71f6b9e651c76be/69b862e0a6fbd73a6254e5be/c1090649-a1d0-47b7-a12d-058a0c81a0f6.jpg","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0d6bacbc4fba24af0169da6d7aa06481919fb7fa6c0e1b4035\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":9415,"output":577,"cacheRead":16768,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":26760,"cost":{"input":0.023537500000000003,"output":0.008655,"cacheRead":0.0041919999999999995,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0363845}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775922551301}}
